#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:11 552d7d7718a04a26833d852dc767becf
msgid "创建项目"
msgstr "Create a project"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:13 f4874162073049519bc67bf5665213ec
msgid ""
"neptrain workflow init \\\n"
"  --profile slurm \\\n"
"  --ensemble npt \\\n"
"  --dft-backend vasp \\\n"
"  --directory fe-project\n"
"cd fe-project\n"
"neptrain doctor --project project.yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:23 630b2a18bbce4c31883e3560650d9a93
msgid ""
"项目只接受 `schema_version: 8`。自动采样只读取 `sampling.routes`，不再接受 全局 "
"`md.structures`、`md.template_path`、`sampling.conditions` 或 "
"`sampling.progression`，也不在运行时迁移旧配置。"
msgstr ""
"Projects accept only `schema_version: 8`. Automated sampling reads only "
"`sampling.routes`; global `md.structures`, `md.template_path`, "
"`sampling.conditions`, and `sampling.progression` are no longer accepted,"
" and legacy configuration is not migrated at runtime."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:27 c0024f147c9649abb95a3ff15d1dec18
msgid "当前配置职责如下："
msgstr "Configuration responsibilities are:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:29 5fa4eaf763fb485497f2d41ceddecbaa
msgid "`md`：选择 LAMMPS/GPUMD 和推理后端。"
msgstr "`md`: select LAMMPS or GPUMD and the inference backend."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:30 b07235359e174ebfb1fe20648e65cc1c
msgid "`labeling`：选择 VASP、ABACUS 或微调后的等变 Teacher 模型。"
msgstr ""
"`labeling`: select VASP, ABACUS, or a fine-tuned equivariant teacher "
"model."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:31 196ccca05961406693a20155e2d1ddf4
msgid "`sampling.routes`：每条采样路径显式绑定结构、模板和温度路径。"
msgstr ""
"`sampling.routes`: bind structures, a template, and a temperature path "
"explicitly for each sampling route."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:32 4509c65209214937971b90e7af44bccf
msgid "`sampling.candidate_pool` / `sampling.selection`：可选的高级覆盖项。"
msgstr ""
"`sampling.candidate_pool` / `sampling.selection`: optional advanced "
"overrides."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:33 0f72001fe8b543e3b7dc0d60ff4a44c4
msgid ""
"LAMMPS 模板：物理过程、`timestep`、阻尼、spin 积分参数和 dump 频率。 内置模板使用 `{{ dump_interval"
" }}`：短轨迹约保留 100 帧，长轨迹最多每 1000 步输出一帧。自定义模板可以复用该变量，也可以显式固定间隔。"
msgstr ""
"LAMMPS templates define the physical process, `timestep`, damping, spin "
"integration parameters, and dump frequency. Built-in templates use `{{ "
"dump_interval }}` to retain about 100 frames for short trajectories and "
"write at most one frame every 1,000 steps for long trajectories. Custom "
"templates may reuse this variable or set a fixed interval explicitly."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:36 46df7d4a61664c75bba975c8f62d9caa
msgid "`execution.targets.*.setup_script`：module、Python 环境和 LAMMPS plugin。"
msgstr ""
"`execution.targets.*.setup_script`: modules, Python environment, and the "
"LAMMPS plugin."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:42 7840c9198999403e955357069dbea7cd
msgid "最小 route 只需要："
msgstr "A minimal route needs only:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:44 d5dc3dfb00864463bf3f6f00e081aa8b
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  routes:\n"
"    - id: default\n"
"      structures: [./structures]\n"
"      template_path: ./lammps.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [300, 600, 900]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:54 50da29545eed4d9bac8f905c4f912603
msgid ""
"省略项采用一套固定默认值：压强为 `0`，全部温度都是生产温度，FPS 每轮最多 选择 `100` 个结构，炸前帧和坏尾帧分别为 `2` 和 "
"`1`。默认递进策略为："
msgstr ""
"Omitted settings use fixed defaults: pressure is `0`, every temperature "
"is a production temperature, FPS selects at most `100` structures per "
"round, and the pre-failure and bad-tail windows are `2` and `1` frames. "
"The default progression is:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:57 584cedc6056d430a9bb9e6295b6b5497
msgid ""
"progression:\n"
"  steps:\n"
"    smoke_passed: 10000\n"
"    short_stable: 40000\n"
"    long_stable: 160000\n"
"    production_ready: 640000\n"
"  replicas:\n"
"    smoke_passed: 1\n"
"    short_stable: 1\n"
"    long_stable: 2\n"
"    production_ready: 3\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:71 7dc318d7d28d4b1cb5ce173bab3de877
msgid "只有需要改变这些值时才写进项目。一个 workflow 也可以配置多条 route："
msgstr ""
"Add these values to the project only when you need to change them. A "
"workflow may also define multiple routes:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:73 257373534db8472a904b5be86f58e6ad
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  routes:\n"
"    - id: route_a\n"
"      structures: [./structures/a.xyz]\n"
"      template_path: ./templates/a.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [300, 600, 900]\n"
"    - id: route_b\n"
"      structures: [./structures/b.xyz]\n"
"      template_path: ./templates/b.in\n"
"      conditions:\n"
"        temperature_path: [500, 1000, 1500]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:88 8afe6e57d3f1444d92444619434a7259
msgid ""
"一个 workflow 会调度全部 route。同一个结构可以显式出现在多条 route 中； `route_id` "
"和内容指纹会隔离场景成熟度与恢复结果。高级 route 可以显式覆盖 `production_temperatures`、`pressure` "
"和整套 `progression`。"
msgstr ""
"One workflow schedules every route. A structure may explicitly appear in "
"multiple routes; `route_id` and the content fingerprint isolate scenario "
"maturity and recovery results. Advanced routes may override "
"`production_temperatures`, `pressure`, and the complete `progression`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:92 5af2071e457945f39f42391733c75cdb
msgid "需要在飞书群中接收每轮完成和流程终态时，在 `project.yaml` 直接配置自定义 机器人："
msgstr ""
"To receive generation-completion and terminal workflow notifications in a"
" Feishu group, configure a custom bot directly in `project.yaml`:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:95 c72ccb4b26054e47b9fa79322c282d9b
msgid ""
"notifications:\n"
"  feishu:\n"
"    webhook: https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/REPLACE\n"
"    secret: REPLACE\n"
"    timeout_seconds: 5\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:103 eeee7c49fcf24c6eba144001fb07aa79
msgid ""
"`neptrain doctor --project project.yaml` 会真实发送一条测试消息，同时验证网络、 "
"签名和飞书响应。Controller 运行时只把通知事件放入后台线程；网络超时、签名失败、 飞书拒绝或通知状态文件异常均不会改变 workflow"
" 状态、退出码或科学 ledger。 每个已接受 generation 报告采样、选样、标注、训练集变化和验证 RMSE；流程完成、 "
"失败、评估拒绝、停滞或预算耗尽另发终态消息。投递去重和结果保存在 `.neptrain/notifications.json`，`neptrain"
" workflow status` 会显示其健康状态。 每条进度和终态消息都会显示 workflow 名称与绝对路径，便于区分并发运行的任务。"
msgstr ""
"`neptrain doctor --project project.yaml` sends a real test message and "
"validates network access, the signature, and Feishu's response. During a "
"run, the Controller places notification events on a background thread. "
"Network timeouts, signature errors, Feishu rejections, or a damaged "
"notification state file never change the workflow state, exit code, or "
"scientific ledger. Each accepted generation reports sampling, selection, "
"labeling, training-set changes, and validation RMSE. Completion, failure,"
" evaluation rejection, stagnation, and budget exhaustion produce separate"
" terminal messages. Delivery deduplication and results are stored in "
"`.neptrain/notifications.json`, whose health is shown by `neptrain "
"workflow status`. Every progress and terminal message includes the "
"workflow name and absolute path so concurrent runs are easy to "
"distinguish."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:111 0e26793dfa4d4edfaddb8f0dacf8c5fa
msgid "Slurm 分析任务需要随候选池增长保留内存余量时，可以给独立 analysis target 配置有上限的内存阶梯："
msgstr ""
"When a Slurm analysis task needs memory headroom as the candidate pool "
"grows, configure a bounded memory ladder on a dedicated analysis target:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:114 64755ae1994d45e5acefc7479f4828b5
msgid ""
"execution:\n"
"  stage_targets:\n"
"    analysis: analysis-cpu\n"
"  targets:\n"
"    analysis-cpu:\n"
"      executor: slurm\n"
"      partition: cpu\n"
"      cpus_per_task: 1\n"
"      memory_ladder: [4G, 8G, 16G]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:126 8d7c1b66bdb54aa0839a65e6a8d2ad37
msgid ""
"第一次提交使用 4G。只有 `select` 因 Slurm OOM 失败时，Controller 才会自动创建 可追踪的新 "
"attempt，并依次使用 8G、16G；达到最后一级仍失败时流程正常进入 `failed`，不会无限重试。不要同时在 `directives` "
"中再写 `--mem`。"
msgstr ""
"The first submission uses 4G. Only when `select` fails because of a Slurm"
" OOM does the Controller create a traceable new attempt and advance to "
"8G, then 16G. If the last level still fails, the workflow enters `failed`"
" normally instead of retrying indefinitely. Do not also specify `--mem` "
"in `directives`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:130 dd2c4fdd64544e818c16b026b401cd92
msgid ""
"默认情况下，全部 route 使用 `execution.stage_targets.sampling`。需要把某条 route 送到另一台 "
"Slurm 平台时，只写例外映射："
msgstr ""
"By default, every route uses `execution.stage_targets.sampling`. To send "
"one route to another Slurm platform, add only the exception mapping:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:133 86da54035147458e8e11cb3210a1869a
msgid ""
"execution:\n"
"  stage_targets:\n"
"    training: train\n"
"    sampling: md-default\n"
"    labeling: label\n"
"    analysis: cpu\n"
"  sampling_route_targets:\n"
"    route_b: md-remote\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:144 5c8122b5ab7042ed8c50e3fb975f4ae1
msgid ""
"NepTrain 只向 LAMMPS 模板注入 `temperature`、`pressure`、`steps`、`seed`、 "
"`replica`、`model_file`、`structure_file` 和输出路径等变量，不管理 "
"`plugin_path`，也不判断模板是 FIRE、NVT/NPT、spin MD、MC+MD 还是 chemical "
"swap。物理过程、阻尼、积分器和 spin 参数都由模板决定。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrain injects only variables such as `temperature`, `pressure`, "
"`steps`, `seed`, `replica`, `model_file`, `structure_file`, and output "
"paths into a LAMMPS template. It does not manage `plugin_path` or decide "
"whether the template implements FIRE, NVT/NPT, spin MD, MC+MD, or "
"chemical swaps. The template owns the physical process, damping, "
"integrator, and spin parameters."

msgid "选择 `md.backend: gpumd` 时，route 的 `template_path` 指向带占位符的 GPUMD `run.in`。NepTrain 与 LAMMPS 使用相同的 `{{ name }}` 替换语法，不限制模板中的 系综类型，不按参数位置推断温压，也不插入或改写物理命令。升降温、非等向压强、 多个 `run` 阶段和固定数值都由模板控制；未知变量会在启动前报错。"
msgstr "With `md.backend: gpumd`, the route's `template_path` points to a GPUMD `run.in` containing placeholders. NepTrain uses the same `{{ name }}` substitution syntax as LAMMPS. It neither restricts ensemble types nor infers temperature or pressure positions, and it does not insert or rewrite physical commands. The template controls temperature ramps, anisotropic pressure, multiple `run` stages, and fixed values. Unknown variables cause an error before launch."

msgid "GPUMD 模板可用变量："
msgstr "Available GPUMD template variables:"

msgid "例如 `ensemble nvt_nhc 100 {{ temperature }} 100` 保留起始温度 100 K，只替换终止 温度。NPT 的压强占位符应放在希望受任务条件控制的分量上；其它分量及耦合常数保持 原样。工作流按 route 条件组织任务，因此需要模板显式引用相应温压变量，才能实际 施加这些条件。旧的纯数值模板仍按字面执行，不再自动更新温压、步数或种子。"
msgstr "For example, `ensemble nvt_nhc 100 {{ temperature }} 100` keeps the starting temperature at 100 K and replaces only the final temperature. Put NPT pressure placeholders on the components controlled by task conditions; other components and coupling constants remain unchanged. The workflow organizes tasks by route conditions, so templates must explicitly reference the corresponding temperature and pressure variables to apply them. Existing numeric templates run literally and no longer receive automatic temperature, pressure, step-count, or seed updates."

msgid "模板须显式设置 `time_step` 和输出到单个 `dump.xyz` 的 `dump_exyz`；分文件输出 尚不支持。建议使用 `dump_exyz {{ dump_interval }} 0 1` 输出力以供轨迹健康检查。 固定 dump 间隔不会自动缩短，须保证运行期间有完整帧输出。当前步号恢复沿用末次 `time_step`（缺失 Time 时还使用末次 dump 间隔）；变时间步长或变输出间隔的多阶段 轨迹尚不能保证恢复正确步号。GPUMD 与 LAMMPS 共用轨迹健康检查和失败窗口契约。 Spin workflow 仍使用 LAMMPS DynSpin。"
msgstr "Templates must explicitly set `time_step` and `dump_exyz` to write a single `dump.xyz`; separated output is not supported. Use `dump_exyz {{ dump_interval }} 0 1` to include forces for trajectory health checks. A fixed dump interval is not shortened automatically, so ensure the run writes complete frames. Step reconstruction currently uses the last `time_step` (and the last dump interval when Time is absent); correct step numbers are not guaranteed for stages with changing timesteps or dump intervals. GPUMD and LAMMPS share the trajectory-health and failure-window contract. Spin workflows still use LAMMPS DynSpin."

msgid "`temperature`（K）、`pressure`（GPa）、`steps`、`seed`。"
msgstr "`temperature` (K), `pressure` (GPa), `steps`, and `seed`."

msgid "`timestep_fs`（fs，由任务的 ps 时间步长换算）。"
msgstr "`timestep_fs` (fs, converted from the task timestep in ps)."

msgid "`dump_interval`（按任务步数计算的建议输出间隔，只有显式引用才生效）。"
msgstr "`dump_interval` (a suggested interval based on task steps; applied only when explicitly referenced)."

msgid "`replica`、`route_id`、`route_fingerprint`。"
msgstr "`replica`, `route_id`, and `route_fingerprint`."

msgid "`model_file`（`nep.txt`）、`structure_file`（`model.xyz`）、 `trajectory_file`（`dump.xyz`）；这些是运行目录中准备或回收的固定文件名。"
msgstr "`model_file` (`nep.txt`), `structure_file` (`model.xyz`), and `trajectory_file` (`dump.xyz`): fixed filenames prepared or collected in the run directory."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:157 9d2445bf883b4adc9d9675ece4f7af21
msgid ""
"每条 route 的 `conditions.temperature_path` 是有顺序的温度探路路径。例如 `[300, 500, 700, "
"900]` 会先验证 300 K，只有通过后才解锁 500 K。 默认全部温度都会跑到最长时长。显式设置 "
"`production_temperatures` 后，未列入 其中的中间温度只做低成本 smoke 探路。"
msgstr ""
"Each route’s `conditions.temperature_path` is an ordered temperature-"
"probing path. For example, `[300, 500, 700, 900]` validates 300 K first "
"and unlocks 500 K only after it passes. By default every temperature "
"proceeds to the longest duration. When `production_temperatures` is set "
"explicitly, intermediate temperatures not in that list run only the low-"
"cost smoke probe."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:169 eab36d72bedc43a09b29f0f153020298
msgid ""
"所有通过健康检查的 dump 帧都会参与全局选择。FPS 先按精确元素集合分组，只用 相同元素集合的当前 `train.xyz` 做 warm "
"start；每个仍有新颖结构的温压条件先保留 一个锚点，剩余名额完全按全局 novelty 分配。已经学好的低温条件不会再被等额配满， "
"高温或新解锁条件可以取得大部分预算。FPS 使用结构级 NEP descriptor；可选择原有的 "
"全原子平均，也可选择按元素规约的均值与标准差通道，但都不把它描述成逐原子局域 新颖度。"
msgstr ""
"Every dump frame that passes health checks participates in global "
"selection. FPS first groups frames by exact element set and warm-starts "
"each group only from matching structures in the current `train.xyz`. "
"Every temperature-pressure condition that still has novel structures "
"receives one anchor; all remaining seats are allocated by global novelty."
" Mature low-temperature conditions are no longer filled to an equal "
"quota, so high-temperature or newly unlocked conditions can receive most "
"of the budget. FPS uses structure-level NEP descriptors. It can retain "
"the historical all-atom mean or use element-wise mean and standard-"
"deviation channels, but neither mode is presented as per-atom local "
"novelty."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:187 e3a65613f8bb4ef18b2d2b5b489a7e44
msgid "多元素体系建议明确选择按元素规约："
msgstr "For multi-element systems, explicitly select element-wise reduction:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:189 6b366a3e6e0c4086a0556d0c98e19dfb
msgid ""
"sampling:\n"
"  selection:\n"
"    descriptor_reduction: elementwise_mean_std\n"
"    max_selected: 100\n"
"    novelty: auto\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:197 bf45e8daa39c4c7193b1c95b2ac0d793
msgid "`descriptor_reduction` 有两个值："
msgstr "`descriptor_reduction` accepts two values:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:199 a614b56e96f5405cb8a87ab78a65bd26
msgid "`global_mean`：默认值，保留原有的全原子描述符平均；"
msgstr ""
"`global_mean`: the default, preserving the historical all-atom descriptor"
" mean;"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:200 431358c1a2f84aa9bea1deb3967da236
msgid "`elementwise_mean_std`：按稳定元素顺序拼接每种元素的描述符均值和标准差， 避免少数元素或不同元素的变化在总平均中被冲淡。"
msgstr ""
"`elementwise_mean_std`: concatenates each element's descriptor mean and "
"standard deviation in a stable element order, so minority-element or "
"element-specific changes are not diluted by the global mean."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:203 1bb745059a70463093bf4e1e49bade9b
msgid ""
"候选结构、完整 `train.xyz`、自动 novelty 阈值与 FPS 使用同一种规约。切换规约后， 旧规约下的绝对 novelty "
"阈值不能直接复用；`novelty: auto` 会重新按当前训练集估计。"
msgstr ""
"Candidates, the complete `train.xyz`, the automatic novelty threshold, "
"and FPS all use the same reduction. Absolute novelty thresholds from "
"another reduction cannot be reused; `novelty: auto` re-estimates the "
"threshold from the current training set."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:210 d23b3c717db14be8b0fcec483ebe03dc
msgid ""
"workflow:\n"
"  max_model_generations: 24\n"
"  convergence:\n"
"    acquisition_min_r2:\n"
"      energy_r2: 0.95\n"
"      force_r2: 0.95\n"
"      virial_r2: 0.90\n"
"    group_min_force_r2: 0.90\n"
"    min_selected: 50\n"
"    max_outlier_fraction: 0.05\n"
"    acquisition_max_rmse:\n"
"      energy_rmse: 0.01    # 可选的绝对误差安全上限，eV/atom\n"
"      force_rmse: 0.15     # eV/Å\n"
"      virial_rmse: 0.10    # eV/atom\n"
"    consecutive_generations: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"workflow:\n"
"  max_model_generations: 24\n"
"  convergence:\n"
"    acquisition_min_r2:\n"
"      energy_r2: 0.95\n"
"      force_r2: 0.95\n"
"      virial_r2: 0.90\n"
"    group_min_force_r2: 0.90\n"
"    min_selected: 50\n"
"    max_outlier_fraction: 0.05\n"
"    acquisition_max_rmse:\n"
"      energy_rmse: 0.01    # optional absolute-error safety cap, eV/atom\n"
"      force_rmse: 0.15     # eV/A\n"
"      virial_rmse: 0.10    # eV/atom\n"
"    consecutive_generations: 1\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:228 2a1d241bc7e9448bb3e1ace602954470
msgid "这套判据只使用“本轮 FPS 选出的最远结构、DFT 标注之后、并入训练集之前”的旧模型 预测，避免拿训练过同一批结构的模型证明自己收敛。上例要求至少 50 个有效标签（省略 `min_selected` 时为 1，空标签不计入连续达标）；整批 Energy/Force/Virial 的 R²、每个元素的 Force R²、每个实际温压条件的 Force R² 都要 过线，同时三倍参考标准差之外的残差比例不能超过 `max_outlier_fraction`。对常量切片， 完全一致记为 R²=1，否则记为 0，避免未定义值被误判为通过。`acquisition_max_rmse` 是可选的绝对误差安全上限，适合与 R² 联用，防止高方差数据仅靠相关性过关。"
msgstr "These criteria use predictions from the sampling model on the FPS-selected structures after labeling and before training on those labels. The example requires at least 50 labels (`min_selected` defaults to 1; empty labels never advance the passing streak). Configured aggregate Energy/Force/Virial R², per-element force R², and per-condition force R² must pass, and the fraction of residuals beyond three reference standard deviations must not exceed `max_outlier_fraction`. For constant slices, exact agreement gives R²=1, otherwise 0. Optional `acquisition_max_rmse` limits absolute error alongside R²."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:235 1bf3d36bea8e474dba582b0f0ff264ff
msgid ""
"这批结构本身已经是相对训练集的 FPS 最远点，因此默认一代通过即可；确实担心 DFT 样本波动时才把 "
"`consecutive_generations` 调大。workflow 还要求所有生产温压条件已到 "
"`production_ready`，因此低温的一次好结果不会提前终止高温探索。这里没有适用于所有 "
"体系的固定阈值：上例是通用起点，声子、弹性或高精度热力学任务仍应使用面向目标性质 的独立验证集。能量和 virial 的 RMSE 单位为 "
"`eV/atom`，力为 `eV/Å`。"
msgstr ""
"These structures are already the FPS points farthest from the training set, "
"so one passing generation is the default. Increase `consecutive_generations` "
"only when DFT sampling variability is a real concern. The workflow also "
"requires every production temperature-pressure condition to reach "
"`production_ready`, so one good low-temperature result cannot stop high-"
"temperature exploration early. No fixed threshold suits every system: this "
"example is a general starting point, while phonon, elastic, or high-accuracy "
"thermodynamic work should still use a target-specific independent validation "
"set. Energy and virial RMSE use `eV/atom`; force RMSE uses `eV/Å`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:241 d5be0988e0214e5986b7a0f282e9dd4c
msgid "未配置 `workflow.convergence` 时，不会自动判定精度收敛，即使辅助测试误差很小也一样。 `coverage_exhausted` 只表示当前采样路径没有可调度任务；`budget_exhausted` 表示采样代数预算用尽。 两者都不是成功。若生产覆盖已达标但采样精度或连续达标轮数不足，会继续安排生产条件采样，直到判据通过或预算用尽。"
msgstr "Without `workflow.convergence`, the workflow cannot declare accuracy convergence, even if optional test errors are small. `coverage_exhausted` means no sampling tasks remain; `budget_exhausted` means the sampling-generation budget is exhausted. Neither is success. Once production coverage is complete, further production probes collect evidence until the acquisition criteria and passing streak are satisfied or the budget is exhausted."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:253 e19f2550ee5d446e8e0c0650a61bddcc
msgid "采样判据通过后，本代仍会先合并最后一批 DFT 标签，但不会把已看过这些标签的模型 用于收敛判断。Controller 随后创建一个 `finalization` 代，只执行 `train`：在最终完整训练集上训练最终模型并检查产物与来源一致性，不再运行 MD、FPS 或 DFT。 `complete` 只由这个终代产生。为保证最后一个采样代也能自动完成，准备 workflow 时会 在 `max_model_generations` 个采样预算之外预留一个终代；若采样预算用尽仍未通过，预留 代不会被误用作普通采样。"
msgstr "After the sampling criteria pass, merge the final labels and create a finalization generation running `train`. It trains on the complete dataset and checks model outputs and provenance without MD, FPS, or DFT. New workflows reach `complete` only through finalization. One finalization slot is reserved beyond `max_model_generations`; it is never reused for sampling when the budget is exhausted."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:260 3d4f445f2ac6437999c9bf8d17e1fd93
msgid ""
"route 指纹由 route id、模板内容哈希、结构输入内容哈希、规范化 conditions 和 progression "
"共同生成。场景身份还包含具体结构哈希、温度、压强和采样模型哈希。 因此修改模板或 route "
"条件后不能复用旧结果；完全相同的配置和内容可以确定性恢复。"
msgstr ""
"A route fingerprint combines the route ID, template-content hash, "
"structure-input content hash, normalized conditions, and progression. "
"Scenario identity also includes the structure hash, temperature, "
"pressure, and sampling-model hash. Results from an old template or route "
"condition therefore cannot be reused after a change; identical "
"configuration and content remain deterministically resumable."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:264 adabdfb470454554b5a9b6649061da3d
msgid "第一性原理标注与 k 点"
msgstr "First-principles labeling and k points"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:266 79d3fbd959d443fb8314ad5ff2fe0518
msgid "默认让用户输入文件管理 k 点："
msgstr "By default, let the user input file manage k points:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:268 ef5dd21275a44d8c9d6d87ed2b4e8353
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: vasp\n"
"  input_path: ./INCAR\n"
"  resource_path: /shared/potpaw_PBE\n"
"  potcar_manifest_path: ./vasp-resources.json\n"
"  kpoint_mode: auto\n"
"  structures_per_job: 1\n"
"  max_concurrent: 20\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:279 e1f134edee8847ff967f2c5751b3f46d
msgid ""
"`auto` 会优先保留 VASP INCAR 中的 `KSPACING`/`KGAMMA`，或 ABACUS INPUT 中的 "
"`kspacing`。输入中没有这些设置时，适配器才按默认参数生成网格。"
msgstr ""
"`auto` preserves `KSPACING`/`KGAMMA` in a VASP INCAR or `kspacing` in an "
"ABACUS INPUT. The adapter generates a grid from default parameters only "
"when those settings are absent."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:282 e43684984f8840ccbcf5a76639dfcdc2
msgid ""
"`structures_per_job` 决定每个 VASP/ABACUS 调度任务包含多少个 FPS 选中结构； "
"`max_concurrent` 限制 workflow 同时运行的标注任务数。默认值分别为 `1` 和 `20`。例如 FPS 选中 100 "
"个结构时，默认生成 100 个单结构任务，最多同时运行 20 个。Controller "
"只合并正常完成并通过标签校验的结构。任何失败或取消的标注任务 都会保存诊断后跳过，不再重试，也不会阻塞其余任务；最终结果仍按原始 FPS 顺序写入"
" `selected-labels.xyz`。如果本轮没有任何标注通过，workflow 会进入 `stalled`， 不会用空数据继续训练。"
msgstr ""
"`structures_per_job` controls how many FPS-selected structures go into "
"each scheduled VASP or ABACUS task; `max_concurrent` limits the number of"
" labeling tasks running at once. Their defaults are `1` and `20`. If FPS "
"selects 100 structures, the default creates 100 single-structure tasks "
"with at most 20 running concurrently. The Controller merges only "
"structures whose labeling tasks completed normally and passed label "
"validation. Every failed or cancelled labeling task is preserved for "
"diagnosis and skipped; it is not retried and does not block the remaining"
" tasks. Successful labels are still written to `selected-labels.xyz` in "
"the original FPS order. If no label passes validation, the workflow "
"enters `stalled` instead of continuing training with an empty dataset."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:290 6b26457837754b638e8823a3d307c379
msgid ""
"VASP 的 `potcar_manifest_path` 和 ABACUS 的 `resource_manifest_path` 是 必填 "
"provenance。它们固定逐元素资源相对路径与 SHA256；VASP 还固定精确 `TITEL`、family 和 "
"release。prepare 会先验证所有 sampling route 的元素覆盖， 本地 target "
"同时验证真实文件。远程资源库不打包上传，远程 labeling target 必须给出自己的绝对 "
"`labeling_resource_path`，并用 `doctor` 在提交前逐文件验证。 manifest 中 `Fe/POTCAR` 或 "
"`Fe_pv/POTCAR` 的 setup 目录会直接驱动 ASE 的 POTCAR 选择，校验路径和计算路径是同一个文件。"
msgstr ""
"VASP `potcar_manifest_path` and ABACUS `resource_manifest_path` are "
"required provenance. They pin per-element relative resource paths and "
"SHA256 hashes; VASP additionally pins the exact `TITEL`, family, and "
"release. Preparation first validates element coverage for every sampling "
"route, and a local target also validates the real files. Remote resource "
"libraries are not uploaded. A remote labeling target must provide its own"
" absolute `labeling_resource_path`, and `doctor` validates every file "
"before submission. A setup directory such as `Fe/POTCAR` or "
"`Fe_pv/POTCAR` in the manifest directly drives ASE POTCAR selection, so "
"the validated and calculated paths identify the same file."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:298 9e5904d719824d4c828a586034f1fd95
msgid "确实需要 NepTrain 接管时再显式配置："
msgstr "Configure an explicit override only when NepTrain must take control:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:300 eebe855c3fd9417f95cba7808a20ba09
msgid ""
"# 按间距设置\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kspacing\n"
"  kspacing: 0.2\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
"\n"
"# 或按网格密度参数设置\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kpoints\n"
"  kpoints: [4, 4, 4]\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
msgstr ""
"# Set by spacing\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kspacing\n"
"  kspacing: 0.2\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"
"\n"
"# Or set by grid-density parameters\n"
"labeling:\n"
"  kpoint_mode: kpoints\n"
"  kpoints: [4, 4, 4]\n"
"  gamma_centered: true\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:314 0638229985874f67924e6b89521ecfc8
msgid ""
"`kspacing` 和 `kpoints` 不能同时配置。手动命令保持同样规则： `neptrain label --kspacing 0.2 "
"...` 或 `neptrain label --ka 4,4,4 ...`； 两者互斥。当前输入接口读取 INCAR/ABACUS INPUT "
"内的 k 点间距，不把同目录下 单独的 VASP `KPOINTS` 或 ABACUS `KPT` 文件作为自动 workflow 输入。"
msgstr ""
"`kspacing` and `kpoints` cannot be configured together. Standalone "
"commands follow the same rule: `neptrain label --kspacing 0.2 ...` and "
"`neptrain label --ka 4,4,4 ...` are mutually exclusive. The current input"
" interface reads k-point spacing from INCAR or ABACUS INPUT; it does not "
"treat a separate VASP `KPOINTS` or ABACUS `KPT` file in the same "
"directory as automatic workflow input."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:319 2e5153477f23497c87ca354b9eacab00
msgid "等变 Teacher 模型"
msgstr "Equivariant teacher models"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:321 eb8b777f2cef47b097a3c5a1eda341d5
msgid "当预训练或微调后的大模型直接替代 DFT 时，workflow stage 不变，只切换 Label Adapter："
msgstr ""
"When a pretrained or fine-tuned large model replaces DFT directly, keep "
"the workflow stages unchanged and switch only the Label Adapter:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:324 c79f36192eb5428b9c914e1c99307507
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./mace-small.model\n"
"  model_name: mace-mp-0-small\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker mace\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:334 1f1e9391125240b8a1d82f9f4fa4157c
msgid ""
"`model_path` 会作为内容寻址输入进入 label task；`model_name`、模型 SHA256、 runner、device"
" 和 precision 会写入 `label-provenance.json`；extxyz 帧本身保留 标签来源、后端、模型名称和模型 "
"SHA256。runner 在 `execution.stage_targets.labeling` 指定的环境执行，因此 Teacher 框架的"
" PyTorch/CUDA 依赖不需要安装到 Controller 环境。"
msgstr ""
"`model_path` enters the label task as content-addressed input. "
"`model_name`, the model SHA256, runner, device, and precision are written"
" to `label-provenance.json`; each extxyz frame retains its label source, "
"backend, model name, and model SHA256. The runner executes in the "
"environment selected by `execution.stage_targets.labeling`, so the "
"Controller environment does not need the teacher framework’s PyTorch/CUDA"
" dependencies."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:340 4111d56243884ef295520deb3f65b4e3
msgid ""
"MACE 适配器由 `NepTrain[mace]` 提供，要求本地 checkpoint 文件和正体积周期 晶胞；它输出 "
"energy、forces 和按 `-stress × volume` 转换的 virial。MACE 不输出磁力，所以这个 runner 不支持"
" spin workflow。"
msgstr ""
"The MACE adapter is provided by `NepTrain[mace]` and requires a local "
"checkpoint plus a periodic cell with positive volume. It outputs energy, "
"forces, and virial converted as `-stress × volume`. MACE does not emit "
"magnetic forces, so this runner does not support spin workflows."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:344 298c8755d2fd4a628c30c50389d29c5a
msgid "DeepMD 适配器由 `NepTrain[deepmd]` 提供。DPA-3 多任务模型可写成："
msgstr ""
"The DeepMD adapter is provided by `NepTrain[deepmd]`. A multitask DPA-3 "
"model can be configured as:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:346 3b21f7e0f6d34e8fafd7767c33307ba8
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./DPA-3.2-5M.pt\n"
"  model_name: dpa-3.2-5m-omol25\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker deepmd --head OMol25\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:356 7e8c6108e87640e09c98d07b0ea0cedf
msgid ""
"DPA-4 使用相同 runner 和本地 `.pt2` 模型；不新增 workflow backend。模型格式、 head 和推理后端由 "
"DeePMD-kit 处理，NepTrain 仍按本地文件内容记录 SHA256。 当前 DPA-4 要求 DeePMD-kit 3.2 "
"或更新版本。DeepMD runner 同样不生成 `mforce`，因此不支持 spin workflow。"
msgstr ""
"DPA-4 uses the same runner with a local `.pt2` model; it does not add "
"another workflow backend. DeePMD-kit handles model format, head, and "
"inference backend, while NepTrain records the local file’s SHA256. DPA-4 "
"currently requires DeePMD-kit 3.2 or later. The DeepMD runner also does "
"not emit `mforce` and therefore does not support spin workflows."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:361 229aafdd56dc4e67855acee4b70f4744
msgid "TACE runner 复用官方 `tace-eval` 批量推理，并把它写出的预测 extxyz 归一成 NepTrain 标签："
msgstr ""
"The TACE runner reuses the official `tace-eval` batch inference command "
"and normalizes its prediction extxyz into NepTrain labels:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:364 3b21f7e0f6d34e8fafd7767c33307ba8
msgid ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./TACE-OAM-7M.pt\n"
"  model_name: TACE-OAM-7M\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker tace --fidelity-index 0\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"
msgstr ""
"labeling:\n"
"  backend: model\n"
"  model_path: ./TACE-OAM-7M.pt\n"
"  model_name: TACE-OAM-7M\n"
"  runner: neptrain model-worker tace --fidelity-index 0\n"
"  device: cuda\n"
"  precision: float32\n"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:374 e019b1daade8489c99f2371579b75c85
msgid ""
"`--fidelity-index` 会写入传给 TACE 的临时输入结构；省略时保留模型或输入的默认 fidelity。NepTrain "
"要求模型至少输出 energy、forces，以及 stress 或 virial。 stress 会按 `-stress × volume` "
"转为 virial，TACE 直接输出的 virial 则原样保留。 普通 TACE checkpoint 不能标注 spin 数据；只有真实输出"
" `noncollinear_magnetic_forces` 的模型才会被映射为标准 `mforce`。"
msgstr ""
"`--fidelity-index` is written into the temporary input structures passed "
"to TACE; omit it to keep the model or input default. NepTrain requires at"
" least energy, forces, and either stress or virial. Stress is converted "
"as `-stress × volume`, while a virial emitted directly by TACE is "
"preserved. An ordinary TACE checkpoint cannot label spin data; only a "
"model that actually emits `noncollinear_magnetic_forces` is mapped to "
"canonical `mforce`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:380 ca05ccc9d8de482289518ba80a1cce0d
msgid ""
"这里的 `model-worker` 是 label stage 的内部协议，不是独立产品入口；用户仍通过 `neptrain label` 或 "
"workflow 启动标注。"
msgstr ""
"`model-worker` is an internal protocol for the label stage, not a "
"separate product entry point. Users still start labeling through "
"`neptrain label` or a workflow."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:383 131ce27ac7c6471392200bdd2ce768cc
msgid "这一路径在调度上完全替代 DFT，但报告会保留 `teacher_model` 来源，避免把蒸馏 标签误称为 DFT 标签。`evaluation.validation_path` 仅提供辅助测试报告，不决定流程是否继续或收敛。"
msgstr "This path replaces DFT in scheduling, while reports retain `teacher_model` provenance so distilled labels are not presented as DFT labels. `evaluation.validation_path` provides an optional diagnostic report and does not control progression or convergence."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:387 d6d2b8850a2448e3934aa6f8f4d28371
msgid "准备和运行"
msgstr "Prepare and run"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:389 d78f54d8c37d417db550dfb7d35431df
msgid ""
"neptrain workflow run project.yaml --prepare-only\n"
"neptrain workflow run workflow\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:394 6754ee66ce7a4a3c8dda368311b647a7
msgid ""
"第一条命令只创建不可变输入快照，输出的“下一步”命令可以直接复制执行。 不需要人工检查快照时，也可以直接运行 `neptrain "
"workflow run project.yaml`，一次完成创建和启动。"
msgstr ""
"The first command creates only an immutable input snapshot, and its "
"returned `next_action` can be copied and run directly. If manual snapshot"
" inspection is unnecessary, run `neptrain workflow run project.yaml` to "
"create and start the workflow in one step."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:406 f0bfc98e955a45d1b9a00e5a368c2001
msgid ""
"`workflow run <目录>` 只允许状态为 `prepared` 的目录第一次启动。 `workflow resume <目录>` "
"只用于已经启动过的暂停、失败、中断或可修复损坏状态； 对 prepared 目录会明确要求使用 `run`。失败目录再次执行 `run` "
"也会被拒绝并指向 `resume`，因此“首次启动”和“恢复”不会共享一条含糊路径。"
msgstr ""
"`workflow run <directory>` starts a directory only when its state is "
"`prepared`. `workflow resume <directory>` is only for workflows that have"
" already started and are paused, failed, interrupted, or repairably "
"damaged; a prepared directory explicitly directs you to `run`. Running "
"`run` again on a failed directory is also rejected and points to "
"`resume`, so first start and recovery do not share an ambiguous path."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:411 c26716ec4ce9421593f914130f247b9f
msgid "状态与恢复"
msgstr "Status and recovery"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:455 fe12ab3f7bda44ed94bb574ad7c308fe
msgid ""
"Controller 不依赖 Slurm `afterok`。失败后只重跑 ledger 中未完成的阶段；已完成 workflow 使用 "
"`resume` 是安全 no-op。`workflow run` 接受项目 YAML 或 workflow 目录：对尚未启动的准备目录返回 "
"`action: start`；`workflow resume` 用于暂停、 失败或中断后的恢复。"
msgstr ""
"The Controller does not depend on Slurm `afterok`. After failure, it "
"reruns only stages not committed in the ledger; `resume` on a completed "
"workflow is a safe no-op. `workflow run` accepts a project YAML or "
"workflow directory and returns `action: start` for a prepared directory "
"that has not started. Use `workflow resume` after pause, failure, or "
"interruption."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:460 686b9d5409364476912bdb0f32d31167
msgid "状态语义如下："
msgstr "State semantics are:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:462 bb43630f43174fdbb2bdaeb6465de978
msgid "`prepared`：只有不可变输入快照，下一步是 `workflow run`。"
msgstr ""
"`prepared`: only the immutable input snapshot exists; run `workflow run` "
"next."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:463 17509f15401b49f69cde7c342ec903a2
msgid "`running`：Controller lock 存在且当前任务可观察。"
msgstr "`running`: the Controller lock exists and the current task is observable."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:464 ceb930f1caaa40c8a61fd56eb289d5a0
msgid ""
"`degraded`：临时 SSH/scheduler 查询失败，Controller 保留原 handle 并重试； "
"连接恢复后自动继续，不会把传输故障冒充为计算失败。只有 scheduler 明确返回 失败、取消或确认任务丢失时，才进入 `failed`。"
msgstr ""
"`degraded`: a temporary SSH or scheduler query failed; the Controller "
"retains the original handle and retries. It resumes automatically after "
"the connection recovers and does not present a transport outage as a "
"compute failure. It enters `failed` only after the scheduler explicitly "
"reports a failure or cancellation, or confirms that the task was lost."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:467 6eec7308ecef4c528a3e995450d9a24f
msgid "`paused`：Controller 已停止或 PID/lock 不在，但远端工作和 current intent 保留。"
msgstr ""
"`paused`: the Controller stopped or its PID/lock is absent, but remote "
"work and current intent remain."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:468 93ac19daec6641ab81dae78ff41a2ede
msgid "`failed` / `rejected`：执行失败或科学验收失败，可按记录创建新 attempt 恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`failed` / `rejected`: execution or scientific acceptance failed; "
"recovery may create a new recorded attempt."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:469 466cdb163ee941a182d7c18639ff02e4
msgid ""
"`damaged`：已提交 artifact、ledger 或 publication 不满足 hash/身份契约。 resume 只修复 "
"hash 一致的冗余副本和可见投影；无法证明来源时在提交新任务前 fail closed。"
msgstr ""
"`damaged`: a committed artifact, ledger, or publication violates its hash"
" or identity contract. Resume repairs only hash-identical redundant "
"copies and visible projections; when provenance cannot be proven, it "
"fails closed before submitting any new task."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:472 945e2a2d9cf142b0a7417511e0e2ec0a
msgid "`budget_exhausted`：模型代数预算耗尽，先 `workflow extend`，不是成功。"
msgstr ""
"`budget_exhausted`: the model-generation budget is exhausted. Run "
"`workflow extend`; this is not success."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:475 9f750ce6e3cd4cc4812adc103611edcf
msgid "`complete`：采样精度和生产覆盖判据已通过，并完成最终训练与模型检查。"
msgstr "`complete`: acquisition accuracy and production coverage criteria passed, and final training and model checks completed."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:477 4bb1982c36c84b0ebeec5e7b1ee5d465
msgid "`workflow.max_model_generations` 是采样代预算，不包含自动预留的最终训练代，也不是 成功条件。辅助测试不阻止最终训练代完成。预算用尽但仍未收敛时状态为 `budget_exhausted`， 没有可调度采样任务时为 `coverage_exhausted`，都不会伪装成 `complete`。"
msgstr "`workflow.max_model_generations` budgets sampling generations, excludes the reserved finalization generation, and is not a success criterion. Optional tests do not block finalization. An exhausted budget yields `budget_exhausted`; no remaining sampling tasks yields `coverage_exhausted`. Neither is reported as `complete`."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:482 f045acb94e6a48279e30c2670e743689
msgid "`training.test_path` 和整个 `evaluation` 都可省略。前者供训练后端输出测试误差；后者的 `validation_path` 用于辅助测试，`max_rmse` 只是可选参考阈值，不会回填到采样收敛阈值。 辅助测试缺失、与训练集重叠、误差超限或预测失败，都不参与重训、模型启用、额外采样和收敛决策。 重叠帧数、参考阈值结果和告警会保留；未提供测试、预测失败或存在重叠时，`validation_accepted` 保持为空。 这两个可选数据集未配置、文件为空（包括仅含空白字符）或路径不存在时，跳过对应测试；已配置但不可用时提示，不阻塞准备、训练、任务打包或恢复。主训练数据、模型产物和新增标签仍必须有效；非空测试文件仍进行格式与标签校验；doctor 和准备流程发现格式损坏、标签缺失或不匹配时，也会提示并跳过该测试集。"
msgstr "Both `training.test_path` and the entire `evaluation` section are optional. The former supplies test data to the training backend; `evaluation.validation_path` supplies diagnostic data, and optional `max_rmse` values are reference thresholds only, never acquisition thresholds. Absent tests, training overlap, excessive test error, and test prediction failures do not control retraining, model activation, extra sampling, or convergence. Overlap counts, reference-threshold results, and warnings are retained. `validation_accepted` stays null for absent tests, failed predictions, or overlap. Both optional datasets are skipped when unset, empty (including whitespace-only files), or missing. An unavailable configured dataset produces a warning without blocking preparation, training, task packaging, or resume. Training data, model outputs, and new labels must remain valid; nonempty test files still undergo format and label validation. If doctor or preparation finds malformed data, missing labels, or incompatible labels, it warns and skips that test dataset."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:486 c0f94c606f2444a78cb63c60a7e8a7f1
msgid "默认停止 Controller，并取消当前 process 或 Slurm 作业："
msgstr ""
"By default, stop the Controller and cancel the current process or Slurm "
"jobs:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:488 ea48e2ec410743bc97c95aad3a6cfe73
msgid "neptrain workflow stop workflow\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:492 1bda64bf3cc84fea85b97b6ed65a000c
msgid "如果只想暂时退出 Controller，并让当前计算任务继续运行："
msgstr ""
"To stop only the Controller while allowing current compute jobs to "
"continue:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:494 c09d60bb83e74e4ab4669213b3499979
msgid "neptrain workflow stop workflow --keep-jobs\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:498 6abcac7f34af4a4f9a00dbda805a6d67
msgid ""
"取消动作会记录到 workflow 历史；后续恢复会创建新的 stage attempt。 对 task group，已完成且通过校验的 "
"shard 保留原 task id；只有未完成、取消或 缺失 shard 生成新 attempt。`--keep-jobs` 仅停止 "
"Controller，下一次 resume 先重新观察原 job handle，不重复提交。作业已离开 `squeue` 时还会查询 "
"accounting； 超过有界 grace 仍不存在才按 LOST 处理。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation is recorded in workflow history, and a later recovery "
"creates a new stage attempt. In a task group, completed and verified "
"shards retain their task IDs; only unfinished, cancelled, or missing "
"shards receive a new attempt. `--keep-jobs` stops only the Controller, so"
" the next resume observes the existing job handle before considering "
"resubmission. Jobs that leave `squeue` are still checked through "
"accounting and become LOST only after a bounded grace period."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:504 c43c6844454f43e58f12baa58fb6282f
msgid "每代目录直接对应用户关心的阶段："
msgstr "Each generation directory maps directly to the stages users inspect:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:518 315453b79f634e1c82e1d9f702e23733
msgid "训练模型、loss 和 stdout/stderr 等关键产物会发布到对应阶段目录；`calculation` 软链指向真实执行目录，便于直接排查。各阶段自动出图："
msgstr "Models, loss files, and stdout/stderr are published in the corresponding stage directory; the `calculation` symlink points to the execution directory for troubleshooting. Stages generate these plots automatically:"

msgid "`train/training-convergence.png`：训练 loss 曲线。`train/training-parity-train.png`：训练集参考值与预测值的对角线图；训练器提供 test 输出时另有 `training-parity-test.png`。读取训练器的 `energy/force/virial/mforce_{train,test}.out`，不额外运行预测。TorchNEP 原生输出对应最后一个 epoch，图标题和报告会明确标注；它不一定是流程启用的 best 模型。"
msgstr "`train/training-convergence.png` shows training loss. `train/training-parity-train.png` compares training references with predictions; `training-parity-test.png` is also generated when the trainer provides test outputs. These plots read native `energy/force/virial/mforce_{train,test}.out` files without another prediction run. TorchNEP native outputs belong to the final epoch, which the title and report identify explicitly; this may differ from the best model activated by the workflow."

msgid "`evaluate/acquisition-parity.png`：本代采样模型对新标注结构的预测与参考值对比，这些结构尚未加入该模型的训练集。直接复用 evaluate 的预测结果。对角线图按可用数据展示 Energy、Force、Virial 和 magnetic force，包含理想对角线、RMSE 与绝对误差分布；能量和 virial 使用每原子单位。大数组只对显示点做确定性抽样，RMSE 仍使用全部有限数据。"
msgstr "`evaluate/acquisition-parity.png` compares the sampling model predictions with new labels, before those structures enter its training set. It reuses the evaluate predictions. Parity plots include Energy, Force, Virial, and magnetic force where available, with the ideal diagonal, RMSE, and absolute-error distributions. Energy and virial use per-atom units. Large arrays are sampled deterministically for display only; RMSE uses all finite pairs."

msgid "配置可选辅助测试集时，train 另有 `evaluation-parity.png`；配置参考阈值时还有 `evaluation-metrics.png`。这些辅助诊断不影响收敛，也不要求 test 必须存在。每张图都有对应 JSON 报告，记录来源、模型哈希（可用时）、点数和统计量；没有有效绘图数据时只输出注明原因的报告。"
msgstr "With an optional auxiliary test set, train also produces `evaluation-parity.png`; configured reference thresholds additionally produce `evaluation-metrics.png`. These diagnostics do not affect convergence or require a test set. Each plot has a JSON report recording its source, model hash where available, counts, and statistics. If no valid plotting data are available, only a report explaining the reason is written."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:528 bc76ff358ecb461cba312c64f49c9c1d
msgid "内部 job 也只保留一层输入和一层输出。job 名称已经包含代数、阶段、route、 attempt 和任务指纹，因此输出目录不再重复这些信息："
msgstr ""
"Internal jobs also keep only one input layer and one output layer. Job "
"names already include generation, stage, route, attempt, and task "
"fingerprint, so output paths do not repeat them:"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:531 b2621b8d1f4446f99f2304eb5bdb61be
msgid ""
".neptrain/jobs/g0001-md-default-.../\n"
"├── input/\n"
"├── output/\n"
"│   ├── log.lammps\n"
"│   ├── trajectory.xyz\n"
"│   ├── candidates.xyz\n"
"│   └── md-attempts.json\n"
"├── task.json\n"
"├── execution.json\n"
"└── result.json\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:544 4b27cfcbb5f94d59bc2ee62d1e21b051
msgid ""
"训练的 `nep.txt`、`loss.out`、checkpoint 和训练日志同样直接位于该 job 的 `output/`。默认的单结构 "
"VASP/ABACUS job 也把输入、原生输出、后端日志和 `selected-labels.xyz` 直接放在 "
"`output/`；只有发生真实重试时才出现 `retry-0002/`。每代 `label/` 直接发布 `000001-Ce8Fe16` "
"等软链及最终合并文件， 不再增加 `teacher/`、`attempt-0001/` 或 `calculations/` 层。`input/` "
"也只携带当前阶段真正消费的文件：训练任务不再 复制 MD route，MD 和标注任务不再复制初始训练集及 validation 数据。"
msgstr ""
"The training `nep.txt`, `loss.out`, checkpoint, and logs live directly in"
" that job’s `output/`. A default single-structure VASP or ABACUS job "
"likewise keeps inputs, native outputs, backend logs, and `selected-"
"labels.xyz` directly in `output/`; `retry-0002/` appears only after a "
"real retry. Each generation’s `label/` publishes symlinks such as "
"`000001-Ce8Fe16` and the final merged file directly, without extra "
"`teacher/`, `attempt-0001/`, or `calculations/` layers. `input/` carries "
"only files consumed by that stage: training tasks no longer copy MD "
"routes, and MD or labeling tasks no longer copy the initial training set "
"or validation data."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:551 988ad2841ca1408098917ae5a56436b5
msgid ""
"远端 task 使用内容寻址协议：本地先在临时目录完整生成 `task.json` 和全部输入， 校验 manifest 后打包；远端在独占 "
"lock 下解包、复核 hash，再用一次 rename 发布，worker 不会看到半上传 bundle。结果先写到临时 "
"`output`，完成后原子切换并 发布绑定 task id/spec hash 的 `result.json`；收集端只接受属于当前 "
"workflow instance 的完整结果。旧 workflow 目录删除后重新创建会得到新的随机 "
"`instance_id`，即使配置相同也不能复用旧远端结果。"
msgstr ""
"Remote tasks use a content-addressed protocol. Locally, NepTrain first "
"creates `task.json` and every input in a temporary directory, validates "
"the manifest, and archives it. Remotely, it extracts under an exclusive "
"lock, verifies hashes, and publishes with one rename, so a worker never "
"sees a partially uploaded bundle. Results are written to a temporary "
"`output`, switched atomically, and published with a `result.json` bound "
"to the task ID and specification hash. Collection accepts only complete "
"results belonging to the current workflow instance. Recreating a deleted "
"workflow directory produces a new random `instance_id`; even identical "
"configuration cannot reuse results from the old remote workflow."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:558 b1eb30e899d24373856c3c4c17273377
msgid "状态权威与目录恢复"
msgstr "Authoritative state and directory recovery"

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:560 426090256c69430fafe1c697cdc7b914
msgid "`.neptrain/manifest.json` 只固定 prepare 输入、计划和 workflow instance。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/manifest.json` pins only prepared inputs, plans, and the "
"workflow instance."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:561 73850eebad0a44549c25cb40f5f2e761
msgid "`.neptrain/ledger.json` 是已提交科学阶段的唯一权威和 commit point。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/ledger.json` is the sole authority and commit point for "
"committed scientific stages."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:562 f58cd92a996249cf86e2927f8955664f
msgid ""
"`.neptrain/controller.json` 只保存 attempt、current execution、job handle、 "
"取消与恢复 intent。"
msgstr ""
"`.neptrain/controller.json` stores only attempts, current execution, job "
"handles, cancellation, and recovery intent."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:564 ce09b0150861417888c5c1bcddfd44ea
msgid ""
"job 内 `task.json` 是不可变输入；`execution.json` 是运行观察； `result.json` "
"是通过收集校验前的候选结果。"
msgstr ""
"Within a job, `task.json` is immutable input, `execution.json` is runtime"
" observation, and `result.json` is a candidate result before collection "
"validation."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:566 06d753e12a8d432188939ed0b088694c
msgid ""
"`results/accepted/` 保存不可变发布；`results/current`、根部结果链接和 "
"`generations/*/calculation` 是相对链接投影，可由权威记录重建。"
msgstr ""
"`results/accepted/` stores immutable publications. `results/current`, "
"root result links, and `generations/*/calculation` are relative-link "
"projections that can be rebuilt from authoritative records."

#: ../../source/command/workflow.md:569 5a5c7bc0b50d41e3bd19d14327a56676
msgid ""
"因此，删除可见链接不会丢失科学状态，`resume` 可修复。删除一个有 hash 冗余副本 的 stage artifact 时，resume "
"只会复制完全相同的已验证内容；找不到一致副本、 ledger 缺失、publication 唯一副本损坏或 artifact 路径逃出 "
"workflow 时，状态保持 `damaged`，不会自动回退成 prepared 或启动下游阶段。要彻底重跑请创建新目录， 不要删除 "
"`.neptrain` 或手工编辑 JSON 来“重置”。"
msgstr ""
"Deleting visible links therefore does not lose scientific state; `resume`"
" can repair them. If a stage artifact with a hash-identical redundant "
"copy is removed, resume copies only the exact verified content. If no "
"identical copy exists, the ledger is missing, the only publication copy "
"is damaged, or an artifact path escapes the workflow, the state remains "
"`damaged`; it never falls back to prepared or starts downstream work. To "
"rerun from scratch, create a new directory instead of deleting "
"`.neptrain` or editing JSON by hand to “reset” the workflow."

msgid "`workflow init` 只生成当前选择的 `lammps.in` 和标注后端输入。Spin 流程可使用 `--spin --dft-backend abacus` 或 `--spin --dft-backend vasp`；后者生成 [VASP DeltaSpin](vasp-deltaspin.md) INCAR。"
msgstr "`workflow init` generates only the selected `lammps.in` and labeling input. Spin workflows may use `--spin --dft-backend abacus` or `--spin --dft-backend vasp`; the latter generates a [VASP DeltaSpin](vasp-deltaspin.md) INCAR."

msgid "两种 MD 后端均提供 `timestep_ps`（ps）和 `timestep_fs`（fs）占位符。仅显式引用时才填充；模板中写死的时间步长保持原样。内置 LAMMPS 模板使用 `timestep {{ timestep_ps }}`。任务接口的时间步长默认是 0.001 ps，命令行和工作流未另外设置时沿用此值。压力按所选软件和模板的原生单位直接填充，不做后端间转换。"
msgstr "Both MD backends expose timestep_ps (ps) and timestep_fs (fs). Only explicit placeholders are filled; fixed template values remain unchanged. Built-in LAMMPS templates use `timestep {{ timestep_ps }}`. The task interface defaults to 0.001 ps, also used by CLI and workflow requests unless otherwise set. Pressure is filled in the native units of the selected engine and template, without conversion between backends."

msgid "本地 smoke 验证"
msgstr "Local smoke checks"

msgid "无需 GPU、Slurm 或 DFT 程序，可以先运行："
msgstr "Run this first without a GPU, Slurm, or a DFT executable:"

msgid "`--workflow` 使用正式 `active_learning_v4` 适配器检查 10 个固定场景：未启用自动收敛、无辅助测试、测试路径不存在、空测试文件、测试重叠、测试误差超限、测试预测异常、MD 失败恢复、覆盖完成后继续累计达标轮数，以及有效标签不足。训练、MD 和预测使用确定性的本地替身，标注使用 Toy Teacher；它检查流程契约，不代表真实模型精度或集群运行验证。该组场景固定每代最多选 8 帧，`--max-selected` 只控制基础 smoke 和旧迭代 smoke。"
msgstr "`--workflow` exercises the production `active_learning_v4` adapter in ten fixed scenarios: disabled automatic convergence, absent optional tests, missing test paths, empty test files, test overlap, excessive test error, test prediction failures, MD recovery, additional passing generations after production coverage, and insufficient labels. Training, MD, and prediction use deterministic local doubles; labeling uses Toy Teacher. These are workflow contract checks, not model accuracy or cluster validation. The suite fixes the selection cap at eight frames per generation; `--max-selected` controls only the base and legacy iteration smoke."

msgid "命令输出一个 JSON，`workflow.passed` 和 `workflow.checks` 给出检查结果；详细记录位于 `workflow/workflow-smoke-report.json`，各场景目录保留 ledger、`science.json`、`result.json` 和 `notifications.txt`。通知仅生成文本，不向飞书发送。重复运行请更换输出目录，或显式使用 `--force` 替换这个 smoke 目录。"
msgstr "The command emits one JSON document with `workflow.passed` and `workflow.checks`. Details are saved in `workflow/workflow-smoke-report.json`; each scenario retains its ledger, `science.json`, `result.json`, and `notifications.txt`. Notifications are rendered as text only and never sent to Feishu. Use a new output directory for another run, or explicitly pass `--force` to replace the smoke directory."

msgid "原有 `--iterations N` 保留为旧 Toy 迭代器的确定性与恢复检查，可与 `--workflow` 同时使用；单独通过旧迭代 smoke 不代表新版收敛流程已被覆盖。"
msgstr "Existing `--iterations N` checks determinism and recovery in the legacy Toy iterator and can be combined with `--workflow`. Passing the legacy iteration smoke alone does not cover the new convergence workflow."

msgid "`workflow.convergence.min_selected` 不能大于 `sampling.selection.max_selected`（选样上限省略时为 100）。配置校验会拒绝这种无法满足的收敛要求，并提示提高选样上限或降低最低标签数。"
msgstr "`workflow.convergence.min_selected` must not exceed `sampling.selection.max_selected` (default 100). Configuration validation rejects this impossible convergence requirement and suggests raising the selection cap or lowering the minimum label count."

msgid "新手检查清单"
msgstr "First-run checklist"

msgid "`workflow init` 生成的是待填写的项目。先补齐训练集、训练输入、route 结构、标注资源和环境，再运行 `doctor --project project.yaml`。重复 init 会提示已有文件；不要为继续使用项目而加 `--force`，该选项会覆盖生成的配置、模板、资源清单和环境脚本。"
msgstr "`workflow init` creates a project to fill in. Supply training data and inputs, route structures, labeling resources, and runtime setup before running `doctor --project project.yaml`. Repeated initialization reports existing files. Do not use `--force` merely to continue an existing project: it overwrites generated configuration, templates, resource manifests, and environment scripts."

msgid "`doctor` 将独立问题汇总为 `FAIL`（必须修复）、`WARN`（提示）和 `OK`。缺少 test 或未启用自动收敛只提示。初始种子尚未标注时，先按对应案例完成独立标注，再检查整个项目。环境检查成功不代表 DFT、训练或 MD 已实际通过。"
msgstr "`doctor` collects independent checks as `FAIL` (must fix), `WARN` (informational), and `OK`. Missing test data or disabled automatic convergence only produce warnings. If seed structures are not yet labeled, follow the example to label them before checking the whole project. Passing environment checks does not mean DFT, training, or MD has actually run successfully."

msgid "新项目统一使用 `active_learning_v4`，不再因为缺少 `workflow.convergence` 而切到旧流程。未设置阈值时，状态明确提示`Convergence checks are disabled`（未启用收敛检查）。已有工作目录继续使用其保存的阶段协议，不能通过删除或编辑内部记录迁移。"
msgstr "New projects always use `active_learning_v4`; omitting `workflow.convergence` does not select a legacy flow. Without thresholds, status explicitly says `Convergence checks are disabled`. Existing working directories keep their saved stage protocol; deleting or editing internal records is not a migration path."

msgid "命令输出与恢复"
msgstr "Command output and recovery"

msgid "`workflow run/resume/restart/stop/extend` 默认输出可读摘要；自动化脚本请显式加 `--json`，保持一个完整 JSON 文档。`status` 完成时列出实际存在的模型和训练集路径；尚未收敛时显示的是当前结果，不应视为验收通过。"
msgstr "`workflow run/resume/restart/stop/extend` print readable summaries by default. Automation scripts must request `--json` to obtain one complete JSON document. Completed status lists the model and dataset paths that exist. Before convergence, these are current results, not accepted final models."

msgid "`workflow extend workflow 15` 将采样总预算设为 15；原预算为 12 时只增加 3 代，不是增加 15 代。最终训练预留代不算采样预算。命令会显示变更前后预算，并根据当前状态给出 run 或 resume 等下一步提示。"
msgstr "`workflow extend workflow 15` sets the total sampling budget to 15. From a budget of 12, it adds three generations, not fifteen. A reserved final-training generation is not part of the sampling budget. Output shows old and new budgets and the next action, such as run or resume, according to the current state."

msgid "失败时先查看状态给出的日志、任务目录和失败原因；修复环境或后端问题后再 resume。若需要更改已经固定的结构、模板或采样策略，应修改原始项目 YAML 并选择新的输出目录；保留旧目录的科学证据。stalled 或 coverage_exhausted 不意味着无限重试可以解决问题，需先检查阈值、标签证据和采样覆盖。"
msgstr "On failure, first inspect the logs, task directory, and reason shown by status. Resume after fixing runtime or backend problems. Changes to snapshotted structures, templates, or sampling strategies require editing the original project YAML and choosing a new output directory while retaining old evidence. A stalled or coverage-exhausted workflow needs a review of thresholds, label evidence, and sampling coverage, rather than unlimited retries."

msgid "LAMMPS 运行期间，NepTrain 会按 `sampling.candidate_pool.health` 中的体积比和 最大原子力阈值生成官方 `fix halt` 检查；检查间隔不超过 100 步，也不会大于 当前 dump 间隔。触发后 LAMMPS 使用 soft halt 保留已经写出的完整帧，NepTrain 会读取 halt 的 fix ID 和停止步数，将结果记为 `trajectory_halt`，而不是因为进程 退出码为 0 就误判为完成。只有一个 `run {{ steps }}` 的既有自定义模板会自动插入 检查；包含多个主 `run` 的模板应在合适位置显式写一行 `{{ halt_commands }}`。 元素相关最小距离、mforce 和 spin 幅值仍由统一的轨迹健康检查在回收后判断，避免在 LAMMPS 输入中复制一套不等价的物理算法。把相应 health 阈值设为 `null` 可以关闭 该项检查。"
msgstr "While LAMMPS runs, NepTrain generates native `fix halt` checks from the volume-ratio and maximum atomic-force thresholds in `sampling.candidate_pool.health`. Checks run at intervals no larger than 100 steps or the dump interval. A soft halt preserves complete frames already written. NepTrain reads the halt fix ID and stopping step and records `trajectory_halt`, rather than treating exit code 0 as completion. Existing custom templates with a single `run {{ steps }}` receive these checks automatically; templates with multiple main `run` commands should place `{{ halt_commands }}` explicitly. Element-dependent minimum distances, mforce, and spin magnitudes are checked by the shared trajectory-health logic after collection. Set a health threshold to `null` to disable that check."

msgid "这里的“一代”严格绑定一个模型哈希。新建流程使用 `active_learning_v4`，采样代按 `train → explore → select → label → evaluate → update` 推进：先用上一代 合并后的完整训练集得到新模型，再让这个模型驱动本代 MD。Controller 会枚举该模型下所有已解锁 scenario attempt，并把它们作为独立 process/Slurm 任务一次性提交；全部进入终态后 再合并候选并执行 FPS。不同 route 可通过 `execution.sampling_route_targets` 送到不同平台。所有候选必须由同一个模型产生；候选池 manifest 和每个 extxyz 帧都会记录 `sampling_model_sha256`。旧模型轨迹不能混入新模型候选池。"
msgstr "A generation is bound to exactly one model hash. New workflows use `active_learning_v4` with `train → explore → select → label → evaluate → update`: train a new model on the previous generation's merged dataset, then use it for this generation's MD. The Controller submits all unlocked scenario attempts for that model as independent process/Slurm tasks, waits for terminal states, and then merges candidates and runs FPS. Route-specific targets are configured through `execution.sampling_route_targets`. Every candidate must come from the same model; the pool manifest and each extxyz frame record `sampling_model_sha256`. Trajectories from older models cannot enter the current candidate pool."

msgid "输出目录默认使用 `workflow.id`。所有新建流程均按新版阶段顺序推进："
msgstr "The output directory defaults to `workflow.id`. All newly prepared workflows use the current stage sequence:"

msgid "`resume` 延续 Controller 当前记录的执行意图，不回退已经提交到 ledger 的科学阶段。 需要明确重算本代某个阶段时使用 `restart`。先用 `--dry-run` 查看复用和重算范围， 确认后去掉该选项执行："
msgstr "`resume` continues the Controller's recorded execution intent without rolling back scientific stages committed to the ledger. Use `restart` to recompute a specific stage in the current generation. Inspect the reuse and recomputation plan with `--dry-run`, then remove that option to execute:"

msgid "# 保留已经成功的 DFT shard，只重试失败或未完成的 shard\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from label --tasks failed --dry-run\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from label --tasks failed\n\n# 放弃本代已有的选择结果，从 select 开始全部重算\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from select --tasks all\n"
msgstr "# Keep successful DFT shards and retry failed or unfinished shards\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from label --tasks failed --dry-run\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from label --tasks failed\n\n# Discard the current generation's selection and recompute from select\nneptrain workflow restart workflow \\\n  --generation 3 --from select --tasks all\n"

msgid "`restart` 只操作最新且尚未完成的代次。指定阶段之前的 artifact 保持权威；该阶段 及其下游的已提交记录转入 `recovery_attempts`，当前执行转入 history，不会删除 失败证据。若 current 是 `label` 或 `explore` task group，`--tasks failed` 保留 已收集且校验通过的 shard，只为失败或未完成 shard 创建新 attempt；`--tasks all` 则重建整组任务。仍有 scheduler 作业未终止时 restart 会拒绝执行，必须先 stop 并 完成状态核对，避免重复提交。"
msgstr "`restart` only operates on the latest unfinished generation. Earlier artifacts remain authoritative; committed records for the selected stage and downstream stages move to `recovery_attempts`, and current execution moves to history without deleting failure evidence. For a current `label` or `explore` task group, `--tasks failed` preserves collected and verified shards and creates new attempts only for failed or unfinished shards. `--tasks all` rebuilds the entire group. Restart refuses to proceed while scheduler jobs remain active; stop and verify their state first to avoid duplicate submissions."

msgid "`--from` 使用该 generation 的 ledger 中实际记录的 stage 名。新 `active_learning_v4` 中 `evaluate` 表示“对新增标签评估旧模型”；旧 `adaptive_v2` 中 `evaluate` 仍表示“采样前模型验证”，新增标签评估仍叫 `diagnose`。CLI 不对这个有歧义的名称做猜测或静默转换，`--dry-run` 会列出实际 复用和重算的阶段。"
msgstr "`--from` takes the stage name actually recorded in that generation's ledger. In `active_learning_v4`, `evaluate` assesses the existing model against new labels. In `adaptive_v2`, `evaluate` still means model validation before sampling, and new-label assessment is named `diagnose`. The CLI does not guess or silently translate this ambiguous name; `--dry-run` lists the actual stages to reuse and recompute."

msgid "`workflow status --json` 的 stdout 使用 `neptrain.workflow-status.v1`；run/resume、restart、stop 和 extend 分别使用稳定的 `workflow-control.v1`、`workflow-restart.v1`、`workflow-stop.v1` 和 `workflow-extend.v1`。诊断不混入 JSON stdout。`workflow-control.v1` 始终包含 `workflow_id`、`project`、 `manifest` 和 `action`；`action` 明确区分 `prepare`、`start`、`resume`、 `repair` 与 `noop`，不再另写一份重复的 `started` 布尔状态。"
msgstr "`workflow status --json` writes `neptrain.workflow-status.v1` to stdout. The run/resume, restart, stop, and extend commands use stable `workflow-control.v1`, `workflow-restart.v1`, `workflow-stop.v1`, and `workflow-extend.v1` contracts. Diagnostics never mix with JSON stdout. `workflow-control.v1` always includes `workflow_id`, `project`, `manifest`, and `action`. The action distinguishes `prepare`, `start`, `resume`, `repair`, and `noop`; there is no redundant `started` boolean."

msgid "`stalled`：当前执行不能通过普通 `resume` 继续；检查原因后可用 `workflow restart --from ...` 明确选择重算位置，或者修改策略后新建 workflow。"
msgstr "`stalled`: ordinary `resume` cannot continue the current execution. Inspect the cause, then use `workflow restart --from ...` to select a recomputation point, or revise the policy and create a new workflow."

msgid "训练、MD 和 labeling stage 使用与独立命令相同的 Adapter 和 execution target。 `train` 完成时检查模型产物和来源、启用模型，并生成可选的辅助测试报告。 新流程不再单独运行 `validate`。既有 `active_learning_v3` 目录仍保留其 `validate` 阶段， `adaptive_v2` 目录继续保留原来的 `evaluate/diagnose/merge` stage 和路径； 新版本按 manifest 中已经固化的 protocol 读取，不会重命名或混写旧目录。"
msgstr "Training, MD, and labeling stages use the same adapters and execution targets as standalone commands. Training checks model artifacts and provenance, activates the model, and generates optional test diagnostics. New workflows have no separate `validate` stage. Existing `active_learning_v3` directories retain `validate`, and `adaptive_v2` directories retain their original `evaluate/diagnose/merge` stages and paths. The manifest fixes the protocol; newer versions read it without renaming or mixing existing directories."

msgid "旧 `active_learning_v3` workflow 保留 `validate/`，`adaptive_v2` workflow 仍使用原来的 `evaluate/diagnose/dataset` 目录；这些目录不会 自动迁移。一个 generation 内只使用其 ledger 已记录的那套 stage sequence。"
msgstr "Existing `active_learning_v3` workflows retain `validate/`, and `adaptive_v2` workflows retain their original `evaluate/diagnose/dataset` directories without automatic migration. Each generation uses only the stage sequence already recorded in its ledger."

msgid "默认状态页显示当前代次、阶段进展、数据集增长、最近三次采样评估和已有图片路径；未开始的未来代次及无数据的磁力列不展开。以下是采样部分的输出示意："
msgstr "Default status shows the current generation, stage progress, dataset growth, the latest three sampling evaluations, and available plot paths. Future generations and magnetic-force columns without data are omitted. Example sampling output:"

msgid "NepTrain · Fe-spin\nPath: /work/neptrain/Fe-spin\nStatus: Running | Generation 3/6 | Sampling\nController heartbeat: 14:32:08 (8s ago) (not a job progress timestamp)\n\nSampling progress:\n  default | P=0 (template pressure units)\n    300 K Trajectories complete | Healthy trajectories 2/2 | Target: Long\n    500 K In progress | Finished 0/4 | Running 3 | Queued 1 | Trajectory progress 1–9/10 ps (3/4 readable) | Target: Smoke\n    700 K ○ Not started\n"
msgstr "NepTrain · Fe-spin\nPath: /work/neptrain/Fe-spin\nStatus: Running | Generation 3/6 | Sampling\nController heartbeat: 14:32:08 (8s ago) (not a job progress timestamp)\n\nSampling progress:\n  default | P=0 (template pressure units)\n    300 K Trajectories complete | Healthy trajectories 2/2 | Target: Long\n    500 K In progress | Finished 0/4 | Running 3 | Queued 1 | Trajectory progress 1–9/10 ps (3/4 readable) | Target: Smoke\n    700 K ○ Not started\n"

msgid "控制器心跳与任务检查时间分别标注；Job 状态是控制器最近一次检查的缓存，status 不额外查询调度器。ps 来自本机可读轨迹或日志以及模板 timestep，不使用墙钟时间估算。并行轨迹显示可读进度范围和读取数量；文件暂不可见时说明时间不可读，不将缺失值当作零，也不以最快一条代表整批。执行结束、轨迹正常、已记录等级和生产覆盖分别展示；仅尝试过某温度不能显示为完成，生产覆盖注明证据所属模型。"
msgstr "Controller heartbeat and task inspection times are reported separately. Job states are cached observations from the controller; status does not query the scheduler again. Physical time comes from locally readable trajectories or logs and the template timestep, rather than wall-clock estimates. Parallel trajectories show the readable progress range and count; unavailable files are identified without treating missing values as zero or using the fastest trajectory for the entire batch. Execution completion, trajectory health, recorded maturity, and production coverage are distinct. An attempted temperature is not necessarily complete, and production coverage identifies its model."

msgid "精度主表使用新增结构的训练前预测误差，E/V 为 meV/atom、F 为 meV/Å、M 为 meV/μB。不同代次的评估结构不同，不打印升降百分比来暗示模型提升。最近评估的判据表列出当前值、配置阈值、最差元素与温压条件、异常残差比例、有效标签数和连续达标次数；生产覆盖缺口保留在收敛原因中。训练期间若能读取 loss.out，则显示最新有限训练记录及日志更新时间。"
msgstr "The main accuracy table uses predictions on new structures before training, with E/V in meV/atom, F in meV/Å, and M in meV/μB. Evaluation structures differ across generations, so percentage arrows are omitted. The latest criteria table shows values, configured thresholds, worst elements and conditions, outlier fractions, label counts, and consecutive passing generations. Production coverage gaps remain in the convergence reasons. During training, a readable loss.out supplies the latest finite training record and log update time."

msgid "`--details` 展开所有已有评估和可选辅助 test（仅供参考，统一使用 meV 单位）；默认保留最新提示，但不展开 test 精度。图片路径直接显示在状态页；已完成阶段没有有效绘图数据时说明未出图原因。`--json` 保留完整机器可读数据，不要求普通用户阅读报告 JSON。"
msgstr "Use `--details` to show all available evaluations and optional auxiliary test diagnostics in meV units. Default output retains recent warnings without expanding test accuracy. Status lists plot paths and explains missing plots when a completed stage has no valid plotting data. `--json` retains complete machine-readable data; ordinary users do not need to read report JSON files."

msgid "`--jobs` 按“代次 + 阶段 + attempt + 执行目标”压缩同一批任务，显示执行完成、运行、等待和失败计数。历史失败可能已由后续重试恢复；逐任务结构和检查时间保留在 `--json` 中。"
msgstr "`--jobs` groups tasks by generation, stage, attempt, and execution target, with execution-complete, running, waiting, and failure counts. Historical failures may have been recovered by subsequent retries. Individual tasks and inspection times remain in `--json`."

msgid "[VASP DeltaSpin](https://github.com/aboys-cb/NepTrain/tree/master/examples/workflow-vasp-deltaspin)"
msgstr "[VASP + Slurm](https://github.com/aboys-cb/NepTrain/blob/master/examples/workflow-vasp-slurm/README.en.md)"

msgid "neptrain smoke --profile recovery --workflow --output ./outputs/workflow-smoke\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "一个温压条件在本档 replica 正常结束并通过轨迹健康与诊断检查后晋级。FPS 覆盖度 独立决定哪些结构需要标注：发现新颖结构会触发标注，标签经 update 合并后用于 下一代训练，但不会迫使健康轨迹反复停留在同一时长。晋级后，Controller 同时解锁下一个温度和当前生产温度的下一档 时长。模型更新不会把已经完成的 smoke、short 或 long 证据清零，只有最终 production 认证需要绑定当前模型哈希。`progression.replicas` 控制各时长需要的 独立 MD 次数。"
msgstr "A temperature-pressure condition advances after its replicas finish normally and pass trajectory health and diagnostic checks. FPS coverage independently determines which structures need labels: novel structures trigger labeling, and update merges those labels for training in the next generation. Novelty does not force healthy trajectories to repeat the same duration. Advancement unlocks both the next temperature and the next duration at the current production temperature. Model updates retain completed smoke, short, and long evidence; only final production certification is bound to the current model hash. `progression.replicas` sets the independent MD run count at each duration."

msgid "NepTrain 只在 FPS 前去除训练集已有结构和同一 route 内的完全重复结构，不按固定 stride 抽帧，也不使用候选数量上限提前裁剪。 `sampling.selection.max_selected` 是每个采样轮最多送去 Label Adapter 的结构数， 不是必须填满的配额。`novelty: auto` 只用当前 `train.xyz` 中的同元素结构拟合描述符 中心和逐特征尺度，再从训练集留一最近邻距离估计保守阈值。候选结构只使用该变换， 不参与尺度拟合；因此极端候选不会反向压低阈值。候选低于训练集已有分辨率时不送 DFT。若本轮一个结构也选不到， workflow 会跳过空的 Label Adapter 任务和新标签误差计算，记录覆盖证据，而不是 报错或提交空的 VASP/ABACUS 作业。没有新标签不能补充精度达标证据；如果继续 下一采样代，仍会先执行 train，不会自动复用旧模型跳过训练。需要固定策略时，可显式设置 `selection_threshold` 和 `completion_threshold`。"
msgstr "Before FPS, NepTrain removes structures already in the training set and exact duplicates within each route. It does not subsample by a fixed stride or truncate candidates with a count cap. `sampling.selection.max_selected` limits how many structures a sampling round sends to the Label Adapter; it is not a quota to fill. `novelty: auto` fits descriptor centers and per-feature scales using only same-element training structures in the current `train.xyz`, then estimates a conservative threshold from leave-one-out nearest-neighbor distances. Candidates use that transform without fitting it, so extreme candidates cannot depress the threshold. Candidates below the training set's existing resolution are not sent to DFT. If no structure is selected, the workflow skips empty Label Adapter jobs and new-label error calculation and records coverage evidence, rather than failing or submitting empty VASP/ABACUS jobs. No new labels means no new accuracy evidence. If another sampling generation follows, it still starts with train; it does not automatically reuse the old model to skip training. Set `selection_threshold` and `completion_threshold` explicitly for a fixed policy."

msgid "novelty 只回答“这个结构在描述符空间里是否值得送 DFT”，不能单独证明势函数精度 已经收敛。需要自动停止时，可让 workflow 检查本代采样模型在本轮新标签上的真实 误差；这些结构尚未加入该模型的训练集，因此可作为在线 acquisition canary："
msgstr "Novelty only answers whether a structure is worth labeling in descriptor space; it cannot establish model accuracy convergence. For automatic stopping, the workflow can check the current sampling model's actual errors on this round's new labels. Those structures have not entered that model's training set, so they serve as online acquisition canaries:"

msgid "train → explore → select → label → evaluate → update\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "neptrain workflow status workflow\nneptrain workflow status workflow --jobs\nneptrain workflow status workflow --details\nneptrain workflow resume workflow\nneptrain workflow restart workflow --generation 3 --from label --dry-run\nneptrain workflow stop workflow\nneptrain workflow extend workflow 15\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "generations/0001/\n├── train/\n├── explore/\n├── select/\n├── label/\n├── evaluate/\n└── update/\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "`select/selection-pca.png`：蓝色表示排除训练集重叠、去重后的候选结构，橙色叠加本轮选中结构。使用筛选时已有的结构描述符，在同一个 PCA 基底中投影到 PC1/PC2，坐标轴标注解释方差。超过 20,000 个候选时，均匀抽样拟合 PCA 和绘制蓝色背景，全部选中结构仍会显示；报告保留全部候选的坐标和结构 ID。PCA 只用于显示，不改变 FPS 距离、筛选结果或收敛判断。独立 `neptrain select` 同样生成 `<输出文件去掉扩展名>.selection-pca.png`，背景为该命令过滤、去重后的候选池。"
msgstr "`select/selection-pca.png`: blue points show candidates after excluding training overlap and duplicates; orange points overlay selected structures. Existing selection descriptors are projected onto PC1/PC2 in one shared PCA basis, with explained variance on the axes. Above 20,000 candidates, a uniform subsample is used to fit PCA and draw the blue background; all selected structures remain visible. The report retains coordinates and structure IDs for all candidates. PCA is for visualization only and does not change FPS distances, selection results, or convergence. Standalone `neptrain select` similarly generates `<output-stem>.selection-pca.png`, using its filtered and deduplicated candidate pool as the background."
